        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 373,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 461,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 374,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64945,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64946,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours show variable localization within the vagina.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64947,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>In reported series, patients were aged 41&ndash;69&nbsp;years (mean: 56&nbsp;years) {29664741; 29901522}. Patients present with a vaginal mass or related symptoms such as vaginal discharge or urinary symptoms.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64948,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are rare neoplasms {29664741; 29901522}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64949,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The etiology is largely unknown, although there is a potential link with congenital genitourinary malformations and adenosis exhibiting gastric differentiation {22317878; 29664741}. There is no association with HPV or in&nbsp;utero exposure to diethylstilbestrol (DES).</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64950,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>This tumour may derive from gastric-type adenosis via atypical adenosis {29664741}. <em>TP53</em> mutation may be implicated in pathogenesis.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64951,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>In the reported cases, the tumours have ranged in size from 2.8 to 4&nbsp;cm.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64952,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Histology shows a mucinous adenocarcinoma exhibiting gastric differentiation, identical to cervical gastric-type adenocarcinoma {17460448; 29901522}. The glands typically display voluminous clear/pale, eosinophilic or foamy cytoplasm, prominent cell membranes, and variable nuclear atypia. Intestinal differentiation (goblet cells) and neuroendocrine differentiation are sometimes seen. Benign and atypical adenosis is sometimes present {29664741}. Immunohistochemistry typically shows positive staining with MUC6, HIK1083, CDX2, CK7, CEA, CA19-9, and CA125 and variable staining with PAX8 and CK20. Hormone receptors are usually negative and p16 negative or focally positive. Approximately half of cases exhibit p53 mutation-type staining.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64953,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "<p>See <a style=\"cursor:pointer\" href=\"/chaptercontent/34/508\" target=\"_blank\">section </a><em>Adenocarcinoma, HPV-independent, gastric type, of the uterine cervix</em>.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-10T13:54:32"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64954,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64955,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "<p><em>Essential:</em> prototypical morphology and immunophenotype, as described for cervical gastric-type adenocarcinoma (see <a style=\"cursor:pointer\" href=\"/chaptercontent/34/508\" target=\"_blank\">section </a><em>Adenocarcinoma, HPV-independent, gastric type, of the uterine cervix</em>).</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-10T13:54:44"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64956,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The staging is the same as for other primary vaginal tumours.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 64957,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 347,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Data are limited, but the clinical behaviour appears to be aggressive {29664741}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-08T17:09:48"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]